  "title": "GitHub Copilot Anywhere: From Remote Control CLIs to Cloud Sandboxes",
  "description": "Modern development no longer happens in one place. You might start in your terminal, step away, and pick things back up from another device or let work continue in the cloud. This session explores using GitHub Copilot across environments, from local CLI sessions to full cloud execution with Remote Sandboxes. See how Copilot runs commands, iterates on changes, and continues work without losing context, while you stay in control.\n\nSeating for this session is first-come, first-served. Add it to your schedule to plan your day and arrive early to secure a spot.",
